      `The impact was concrete. The ICC regulations that took effect in November 1961 required desegregation in interstate transportation facilities. The Freedom Rides also trained a generation of activists in direct action, jail no bail, media strategy, and the reality that federal enforcement often followed pressure rather than principle.`
