      `They also matter because they show the discipline behind dramatic images. The burning bus was unforgettable, but the strategy included planning, training, route selection, legal knowledge, phone trees, fundraising, and decisions made by young organizers under pressure.`,
      `A reader should leave understanding that the Freedom Rides were not a spontaneous test of bravery. They were a campaign to make federal law visible, expose defiance, and force action. That kind of citizenship is work.`
